        <mxCell id="PNbuyMzUKA0d4dk30ukL-15" value="This structure is the intestinal loop (green area) of the small intestine and belongs to the digestive system. Its characteristics include a lumen diameter of 2 to 3 cm, a pronounced annular mucosal fold, and a clear mesenteric fat gap." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
